TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Oooh{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}... Sen benim{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}} prensesim
misin? Sonunda sonsuz uykumdan{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}
uyandırmaya{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} geldin! Bir dakika!
Sen de kimsin{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}?!{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Prensese hiç
benzemiyorsun! Ben Gulliver;
yedi, belki{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sekiz denizde adı
duyulmuş mütevazı{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} bir{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
denizciyim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}} Dur... Beni kurtaran
SEN miydin{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}? Eyvah! Kurtarıcıma{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
kabalık ettim!{{TAG:0003:000C:}} Kahraman kalbinle
beni affet! Şu an kafam{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} fena
karışık... Galiba gemiden düşüp{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
denize{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} savruldum. Tipik. Hem de
tarihin EN BÜYÜK fırtınasında
geminin{{TAG:0003:001B:}} kenarında uyukluyordum.
Sonrasını hiç{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} hatırlamıyorum.
Deniz{{TAG:0003:000B:}} amnezisi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} derler. Denizci
olduğuma göre bir yere gidiyor{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
olmalıydım. Hımm... Nereye{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
gidiyordum? Şu yerin adını bir
hatırlasam.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh, I know!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} It's so obvious!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Will you help me figure out where
I was heading?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sure, I'll help you out.
Sorry. I'm kinda busy.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Ah! Senti...{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi daresti una mano
a capire dove ero diretto?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Certo, ti aiuterò.
Scusa, ma ho da fare.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh, ich hab's! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hast du's auch?{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hilfst du mir herauszufinden,
wo ich hinwollte?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Klar.
Bin in Eile...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa, buldum{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}! Bana yardım{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
etmelisin! Hatırladığım her şeyi
anlatacağım{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}; nereye gittiğimi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
birlikte çıkaralım, olur mu?
Zavallı ama{{TAG:0003:000E:}} son derece erkeksi
bir martıyı ortada bırakmazsın,
değil mi?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Elbette, yardım
ederim. Kusura bakma, biraz meşgulüm.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hmm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I guess I must seem very
suspicious to you or something.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Helping people builds good karma,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
so just help me figure this out, OK?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}All right, let's get started.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm going to start telling you
everything I remember.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti manderò un bellissimo souvenir!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Potrei metterci un po', ma vedrai
che ne varrà la pena!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}No sé... No me suena del todo
correcto.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Pero voy a confiar en tu instinto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}En cuanto llegue, te enviaré
un regalo de agradecimiento.
Puede que algo pequeñito.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Revisa el correo de vez en cuando!

{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡El mar es fantástico!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Solo
tú, tu barco y tu destino.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No necesitas nada más.
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Aunque a veces añoro los
macarrones de mi madre.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Aramızda kalsın,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} uzayın uçsuz
bucaksızlığında da{{TAG:0003:001B:}} yolculuk{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
yaptım! Ama macera hikâyelerime
kimse inanmıyor.{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Orada
süzülürken öğrendiğim bir şey
var: Uzay{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} KARANLIK!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
